## @file
#  Synopsys DesignWare Ethernet Quality-of-Service (EQoS) UEFI SNP driver
#
#  Copyright (c) 2025, Mario Bălănică <mariobalanica02@gmail.com>
#
#  From edk2-porting/edk2-rk3588 (edk2-rockchip @ 824e6c12). Changes for the
#  Cubie A7A: accepts Synopsys version 0x53 and takes the link state from the
#  platform protocol's optional GetLinkState; reprograms the link speed after
#  each software reset.
